# Portfolio (elopre.dev)

Before editing this repo, read `docs/PROJECT_MEMORY.md` and map the user’s words to the listed files.

- Keep `index.html` at repo root (GitHub Pages).
- Keep `server.js` at repo root (Render).
- Styles → `css/styles.css`; page logic → `js/main.js`; chatbot → `js/resumeChatbot.js`.
- Brand / project / profile images live under `assets/images/{brand,projects,profile}/`.
- Resume PDF → `assets/documents/`.
- Do not commit `.env` or installer `.msi` files.
